    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n906" root="اطر" body-key="A">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَطِيرٌ</span></b>  <i>A sin; a crime; an offence.</i> (S, K.) One
says, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَخَذَنِى بِأَطِيرِ غَيْرِى</span> <i>He punished me for the
sin, crime,</i> or <i>offence, of another than myself.</i> (S.)

